nce-millet-flickr.jpg 800w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-vince-millet-flickr-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-vince-millet-flickr-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\"> 2. Fox Attacks on Pets & Livestock<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Foxes pose a major threat to small pets, poultry, and livestock. Our fox removal experts in Melbourne focus on protecting animals and preventing future attacks.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9fb9211 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9fb9211\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61c1aef elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"61c1aef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"612\" height=\"451\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/istockphoto-501596959-612x612-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9894\" alt=\"fox den burrow\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/istockphoto-501596959-612x612-1.jpg 612w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/istockphoto-501596959-612x612-1-300x221.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 612px) 100vw, 612px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">3. Fox Dens & Burrowing<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Foxes often dig dens under houses, sheds, and structures, causing structural risks. Fox trapping services in Melbourne are essential to remove them safely.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b744193 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b744193\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ebb5d2 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"6ebb5d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/vixen-fox-cubs_600x600.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9895\" alt=\"group of foxes\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/vixen-fox-cubs_600x600.jpg 600w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/vixen-fox-cubs_600x600-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">4.High Fox Population Growth<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Rapid fox population growth can disrupt local ecosystems. Our fox population control strategies help restore ecological balance.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2956c52 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2956c52\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f5e4d41\" data-id=\"f5e4d41\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-1cc40f8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1cc40f8\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-231dc39\" data-id=\"231dc39\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cee4cbe elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cee4cbe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">why fox coming<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d22bd0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d22bd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Are Foxes Coming Onto Your Property?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59fd6df custom-list elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"59fd6df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2413\"><p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2413\"><strong data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2349\">Food Availability<\/strong> \u2013 Pet food, rubbish, fallen fruit, or livestock attract foxes<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2495\"><p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2495\"><strong data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2434\">Shelter &amp; Dens<\/strong> \u2013 Foxes seek safe places under buildings, bushes, or sheds<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2579\"><p data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2579\"><strong data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2517\">Urban Expansion<\/strong> \u2013 Increased development pushes foxes into residential areas<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2666\"><p data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2666\"><strong data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2601\">Breeding Season<\/strong> \u2013 Fox activity increases significantly during breeding periods<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2747\"><p data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2747\"><strong data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2691\">Easy Access Points<\/strong> \u2013 Gaps, open fencing, and unsecured yards allow entry<\/p><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e1c8d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2e1c8d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If fox activity continues, <strong data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2822\">professional fox pest control in Melbourne<\/strong> is the safest solution.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-60d1b76\" data-id=\"60d1b76\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc6bb88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dc6bb88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9899\" alt=\"fox-adrian-simpson\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/fox-adrian-simpson.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-235b366 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"235b366\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9ef9af e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e9ef9af\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-101ca7a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"101ca7a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4b15cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4b15cb\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c204f1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c204f1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">problems<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5de8f7d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5de8f7d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Problems Can Foxes Cause?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8edb2b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e8edb2b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea758e9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ea758e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Foxes may appear harmless, but their presence can cause serious problems for residential and commercial properties. Below are some of the common issues caused by fox infestations:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1601a40 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1601a40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f4d739 e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2f4d739\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f28a7c6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f28a7c6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-038b414 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"038b414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ants invade kitchens and pantries, contaminating food by carrying bacteria from unsanitary places. This can pose health risks and lead to food wastage.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 1. Food Contamination<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d7d400 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8d7d400\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-183a18e ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"183a18e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Certain ant species, like carpenter ants, burrow into wood to create nests, weakening furniture, wooden structures, and even building foundations over time.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">2. Structural Damage<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93d7870 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"93d7870\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f176a0 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"9f176a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Some ants, such as fire ants, deliver painful bites and stings that can cause allergic reactions, itching, and discomfort, especially for children and pets.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 3. Painful Bites and Stings<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6fe9d0 e-con-full elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6fe9d0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b46a195 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b46a195\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee2eedd ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"ee2eedd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ants are attracted to electrical wiring and appliances, leading to short circuits, equipment failure, and potential fire hazards when they chew on wires.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">4. Electrical Damage<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8f5a1e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a8f5a1e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d90b953 ekit-equal-height-disable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"d90b953\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>Ant colonies grow quickly, and once they establish a nest, they can spread to different parts of your property, making eradication difficult without professional pest control.<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\"> 5. Rapid Infestation Growth<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4299786 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4299786\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5628a19 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"5628a19\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-left text- icon-lef-right-aligin elementor-animation-   \">\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                        \t\t  \t<p><br><br><br>For businesses, especially in the food industry, an ant infestation can damage reputation, lead to health code violations, and even cause financial losses..<\/p>\n                                        <div class=\"box-footer disable_hover_button\">\n                    <div class=\"btn-wraper\">\n                                                            <a class=\"elementskit-btn whitespace--normal elementor-animation-bounce-in\" href=\"#\">\n                                                                            <\/a>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n        \n        \n                    <div class=\"ekit-icon-box-badge ekit_position_custom\">\n                <span class=\"ekit-badge\">6. Business Disruptions<\/span>\n            <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-782d287 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"782d287\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f76bb2b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f76bb2b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87d1dc1 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"87d1dc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center  hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/paws-rg6x0he9jevp85to433n79vwjcrm3a6rluz01u69eo.png\" title=\"paws\" alt=\"paw warning icon\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Threat to Pets &amp; Livestock\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Foxes are natural predators and can attack small pets, poultry, and livestock. This poses serious risks to households, farms, and rural properties.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-987723d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"987723d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a38fed7 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"a38fed7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/property-rg6x1x3dzaugypqkq7g4ieu97josumw04yupg21lwg.png\" title=\"property\" alt=\"property\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Property &amp; Structural Damage\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Foxes dig dens under houses, sheds, and fences. Their burrowing can weaken foundations, damage gardens, and create safety hazards over time.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d83ed9c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d83ed9c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e6391c ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"9e6391c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/risks-rg6x3m6wbj63xd9ttfuvihf7tlbnqymk1d99n1j0o0.png\" title=\"risks\" alt=\"health warning icon\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Health &amp; Disease Risks\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Foxes may carry parasites and diseases that can affect pets and humans. Their presence increases health risks, especially in residential areas.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56e8a94 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"56e8a94\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ff100a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ff100a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-986a3d4 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"986a3d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center  hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/landscape-rg6x694lhss2hzfxf2w70bgrtibqce3g2f5b3zm97k.png\" title=\"landscape\" alt=\"burrow icon\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Environmental &amp; Wildlife Impact\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Uncontrolled fox populations harm native wildlife and disrupt local ecosystems, leading to biodiversity loss.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ff0379 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ff0379\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c94e27 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"9c94e27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/population-rg6x7j6osoj4avl0y4swwhucxe0ptk6akr43mjpyqo.png\" title=\"population\" alt=\"population\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Rapid Population Growth\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Foxes reproduce quickly, and once they settle in an area, their population can increase rapidly, making control difficult without professional fox pest control.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6100e2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6100e2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afefc50 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"afefc50\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center hover_from_right hover-border-bottom\" >\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/field-rg6xan1hdys8oh2jsz5in7m7m8pe9jico4qvqh4468.png\" title=\"field\" alt=\"field\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        Business &amp; Farm Disruptions\n                        \n                    <\/h3>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        For farms and businesses, fox activity can cause livestock losses, property damage, and financial impact, especially in agricultural and semi-urban areas.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12c387c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"12c387c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cbc09e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3cbc09e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-452e0a4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"452e0a4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e47cc08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e47cc08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">7.Monitor Fox Activity<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acb9541 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"acb9541\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Watch for signs like tracks, droppings, or digging<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Act quickly if fox activity increases<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Early action helps prevent population growth<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ffb5b4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ffb5b4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5d1b1b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d5d1b1b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">8.Hire Professional Fox Control Services<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b50781c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b50781c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If fox infestations persist, <strong data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2167\">professional fox pest control in Melbourne<\/strong> is the safest and most effective solution. Licensed experts can provide <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2262\">humane fox control<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2289\">fox trapping services<\/strong>, and long-term <strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2331\">fox population control<\/strong> strategies to prevent re-infestation.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5c5111 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f5c5111\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1d5604 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d1d5604\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0495b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e0495b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Protect Pets &amp; Livestock<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb3d33f elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"cb3d33f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Secure poultry coops with strong fencing<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Keep small pets indoors at night<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Use motion-sensor lights around animal enclosures<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Avoid leaving animal carcasses exposed<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-594c8ee e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data